                  "type": "application",
                  "title": "Study Guide: HIPAA Privacy Rule",
                  "content": "Your RHIT exam study checklist for the HIPAA Privacy Rule:\n\n**PHI & Identifiers:**\n• PHI = individually identifiable health information in ANY form (paper, electronic, oral)\n• 18 HIPAA identifiers -- memorize all 18 (names, geographic <state, dates except year, phone, fax, email, SSN, MRN, health plan #, account #, cert/license #, vehicle ID, device ID, URLs, IP addresses, biometrics, full-face photos, any other unique ID)\n• De-identification: Safe Harbor (remove all 18) vs Expert Determination (statistician)\n\n**Covered Entities & Business Associates:**\n• 3 CEs: health plans, clearinghouses, providers transmitting electronically\n• BAs: perform functions for CEs involving PHI (HITECH = directly liable)\n• BAA required between CE and BA\n\n**Patient Rights (MEMORIZE TIMELINES):**\n• Access: 30 days + 30-day extension, cost-based fee, no search/retrieval charge\n• Amendment: 60 days + 30-day extension, can deny (4 reasons), statement of disagreement\n• Accounting of disclosures: 6-year lookback, excludes TPO, first free in 12 months\n• Restriction: generally voluntary EXCEPT self-pay in full = mandatory (HITECH)\n• Confidential communications: alternative location/means\n\n**TPO & Minimum Necessary:**\n• TPO = no authorization needed, excluded from accounting\n• Minimum necessary does NOT apply to: treatment, patient, authorization, required by law, DHHS\n\n**Authorization:** 6 core elements + 3 required statements\n\n**Special Rules:**\n• Psychotherapy notes: ALWAYS separate authorization (even for TPO)\n• 42 CFR Part 2: MORE RESTRICTIVE than HIPAA, specific written consent\n• Minors: state law governs\n• Deceased: 50-year protection",
                  "visual": {
                    "type": "diagram",
                    "svg": "<svg class=\"lesson-visual\" viewBox=\"0 0 1100 1100\">\n            <rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1100\" height=\"1100\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\"/>\n            <text x=\"550\" y=\"55\" font-size=\"40\" fill=\"#ffd700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">Study Checklist: Lesson 7</text>\n            <text x=\"550\" y=\"100\" font-size=\"27\" fill=\"#888\" text-anchor=\"middle\">HIPAA Privacy Rule — Key Numbers</text>\n            <rect x=\"60\" y=\"130\" width=\"980\" height=\"60\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\" stroke=\"#6366f1\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n            <text x=\"100\" y=\"168\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#6366f1\" font-weight=\"bold\">Timeline</text>\n            <text x=\"400\" y=\"168\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#6366f1\" font-weight=\"bold\">Right/Rule</text>\n            <rect x=\"60\" y=\"195\" width=\"980\" height=\"40\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"rgba(255,255,255,0.03)\"/>\n            <text x=\"100\" y=\"222\" font-size=\"18\" fill=\"#ef4444\" font-weight=\"bold\">30 days</text>\n            <text x=\"400\" y=\"222\" font-size=\"18\" fill=\"#fff\">Right of Access (+30 day extension)</text>\n            <rect x=\"60\" y=\"240\" width=\"980\" height=\"40\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"rgba(255,255,255,0.06)\"/>\n            <text x=\"100\" y=\"267\" font-size=\"18\" fill=\"#ef4444\" font-weight=\"bold\">60 days</text>\n            <text x=\"400\" y=\"267\" font-size=\"18\" fill=\"#fff\">Right to Amendment (+30 day extension)</text>\n            <rect x=\"60\" y=\"285\" width=\"980\" height=\"40\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"rgba(255,255,255,0.03)\"/>\n            <text x=\"100\" y=\"312\" font-size=\"18\" fill=\"#ef4444\" font-weight=\"bold\">6 years</text>\n            <text x=\"400\" y=\"312\" font-size=\"18\" fill=\"#fff\">Accounting of Disclosures lookback</text>\n            <rect x=\"60\" y=\"330\" width=\"980\" height=\"40\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"rgba(255,255,255,0.06)\"/>\n            <text x=\"100\" y=\"357\" font-size=\"18\" fill=\"#ef4444\" font-weight=\"bold\">50 years</text>\n            <text x=\"400\" y=\"357\" font-size=\"18\" fill=\"#fff\">Deceased patient protection</text>\n            <rect x=\"60\" y=\"375\" width=\"980\" height=\"40\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"rgba(255,255,255,0.03)\"/>\n            <text x=\"100\" y=\"402\" font-size=\"18\" fill=\"#ef4444\" font-weight=\"bold\">18</text>\n            <text x=\"400\" y=\"402\" font-size=\"18\" fill=\"#fff\">HIPAA identifiers (Safe Harbor removal)</text>\n            <rect x=\"60\" y=\"420\" width=\"980\" height=\"40\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"rgba(255,255,255,0.06)\"/>\n            <text x=\"100\" y=\"447\" font-size=\"18\" fill=\"#ef4444\" font-weight=\"bold\">6 + 3</text>\n            <text x=\"400\" y=\"447\" font-size=\"18\" fill=\"#fff\">Authorization elements + required statements</text>\n            <rect x=\"60\" y=\"465\" width=\"980\" height=\"40\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"rgba(255,255,255,0.03)\"/>\n            <text x=\"100\" y=\"492\" font-size=\"18\" fill=\"#ef4444\" font-weight=\"bold\">3</text>\n            <text x=\"400\" y=\"492\" font-size=\"18\" fill=\"#fff\">Types of covered entities</text>\n            <rect x=\"60\" y=\"530\" width=\"980\" height=\"80\" rx=\"15\" fill=\"rgba(239,68,68,0.15)\" stroke=\"#ef4444\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n            <text x=\"550\" y=\"565\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ef4444\" font-size=\"20\" font-weight=\"bold\">TOP TRAPS: Access=30d (not 60) | Psych notes=ALWAYS separate auth</text>\n            <text x=\"550\" y=\"595\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"15\">Self-pay=MUST restrict | 42 CFR Part 2 > HIPAA | Min necessary excludes treatment</text>\n          </svg>",
                    "caption": "All critical HIPAA Privacy Rule numbers and timelines for the RHIT exam"
                  }
